{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.QReebFlow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.QReebFlow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Glossary","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.NatTrans","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Group.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.ExteriorAlgebra.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.flow_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.flow_zero","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Initial condition: `φ^q_0 = id`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.flow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.flow","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The flow map at time `t : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow.mk","kind":"ctor","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QReebFlow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QReebFlow","kind":"structure","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L42-L59","doc":"**q-Deformed Reeb flow**: the one-parameter family of diffeomorphisms\n`φ^q_t : M → M` generated by `ξ_q`, with `φ^q_0 = id_M`.\n\n**Flow time is `ℝ`, not `R_q`** (bean `qou-u87j`, 2026-08-23). This field\nread `flow : R_q → M → M` and disagreed with the library\n`QOU.QReebFlow` (`lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/Particles.lean:93`),\nwhich has always had `ℝ`. The block settles it: `q-reeb-flow.md` opens\n*\"In the **archimedean realisation**, the q-deformed Reeb vector field\n`ξ_q` generates a one-parameter family of diffeomorphisms\"* and writes the\ngenerator as the ODE `d/dt φ_t^q = ξ_q ∘ φ_t^q` — real time. The `q` in\n`φ^q_t` deforms the **vector field**, not the time parameter.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-reeb-flow}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:q-reeb-flow","label":"ex:q-reeb-flow","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-reeb-flow.lean#L34-L36","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}